## Context
Audit B1 (`docs/2026-09-24-rules-coherence-audit.md`). climate `.claude/hooks/check-reviews.sh` requires ≥2
review cycles unless `review:trivial`; `AGENTS.md` allows "two review rounds
at most". A clean first round still forces a second. Harness `/gaze` allows
one retry; aedist up to three.

## Decision needed
Recommended: default minimum 1 cycle with an independent reviewer; keep 2 for a
`review:standard` label set on risk. Alternative: keep 2 and record that a
clean round is repeated deliberately.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] Author decision logged here
- [ ] Hook, `review-checklist.md` and `AGENTS.md` agree
